#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.16.rst:39
msgid "For example, to use :class:`asyncio.SelectorEventLoop` on Windows::"
msgstr ""
"例えば、Windows で :class:`asyncio.SelectorEventLoop` を使うには、次のように"
